# Aralytics frontend environment template
# Copy to .env (or .env.local) for local configuration. .env files are gitignored.
# Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_ to the client bundle.
# The current frontend prototype requires no environment variables.

# Example for the future backend integration (uncomment and set when used):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
